## Article 29. International Transfer of Personal Data

```catala
declaration scope InternationalTransfer:
  input destinationCountryEnsuresProtection content YesNo
  input dataSubjectConsent content YesNo
  input isNecessaryForContract content YesNo
  input isNecessaryForVitalInterests content YesNo
  input isNecessaryForPublicInterest content YesNo
  input isWartimeTelemedicine content YesNo
  output transferAllowed content YesNo

scope InternationalTransfer:
  label default_prohibited definition transferAllowed equals No
  
  label allowed_safe_country exception default_prohibited
  definition transferAllowed under condition
    destinationCountryEnsuresProtection = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  # Exceptions from Part 4
  label allowed_exceptions exception default_prohibited
  definition transferAllowed under condition
    dataSubjectConsent = Yes
    or isNecessaryForContract = Yes
    or isNecessaryForVitalInterests = Yes
    or isNecessaryForPublicInterest = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  # Wartime telemedicine exception (Article 30, Part 2)
  label wartime_telemedicine exception default_prohibited
  definition transferAllowed under condition
    isWartimeTelemedicine = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
